{
  "title": "Namaz of Imam al-Hasan (a.s.)",
  "data": "Upon concluding the prayer, say the following supplication:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ اِنِّيْ اَتَقَرَّبُ اِلَيْكَ بِجُوْدِكَ وَكَرَمِكَ\nALLAAHUMMA INNEE ATAQARRABU ILAYKA BIJOODIKA WA KARAMIK\nO Allah, I seek nearness to You in the name of Your magnanimity and nobility.\nوَاَتَقَرَّبُ اِلَيْكَ بِمُحَمَّدٍ عَبْدِكَ وَرَسُوْلِكَ\nWA ATAQARRABU ILAYKA BIMUHAMMADIN A'BDIKA WA RASOOLIK\nI seek nearness to You in the name of Muhammad, Your servant and messenger.\nوَاَتَقَرَّبُ اِلَيْكَ بِمَلَائِكَتِكَ الْمُقَرَّبِيْنَ\nWA ATAQARRABU ILAYKA BIMALAA'IKATIKAL MUQARRABEEN\nI seek nearness to You in the name of Your Favorite Angels\nوَاَنْبِيَائِكَ وَرُسُلِكَ\nWA ANBIYAA'IKA WA RUSULIK\nand Your prophets and messengers,\nاَنْ تُصَلِّيَ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ\nAN TUSALLIYA A'LAA MUHAMMADIN\n[and I beseech You] to send blessings to Muhammad,\nعَبْدِكَ وَرَسُوْلِكَ\nA'BDIKA WA RASOOLIK\nYour servant and messenger,\nوَعَلٰى آلِ مُحَمَّدٍ\nWA A'LAA AALI MUHAMMAD\nand upon the Household of Muhammad,\nوَاَنْ تُقِيْلَنِيْ عَثْرَتِيْ\nWA AN TUQEELANEE A'THRATEE\noverlook my slips,\nوَتَسْتُرَ عَلَيَّ ذُنُوْبِيْ\nWA TASTURA A'LAYYA DHUNOOBEE\ncover my sins,\nوَتَغْفِرَهَا لِيْ\nWA TAGHFIRAHAA LEE\nforgive them for me,\nوَتَقْضِيَ لِيْ حَوَائِجِيْ\nWA TAQDIYA LEE HAWAA'IJEE\nsettle all my needs,\nوَلَا تُعَذِّبْنِيْ بِقَبِيْحٍ كَانَ مِنِّيْ\nWA LAA TU'ADHDHIBNEE BIQABEEHIN KAANA MINNEE\nand not to punish me for the evildoings that I have committed.\nفَاِنَّ عَفْوَكَ وَجُوْدَكَ يَسَعُنِيْ\nFA-INNA A'FWAKA WA JOODAKA YASA'UNEE\nVerily, Your pardon and magnanimity include me.\nاِنَّكَ عَلٰى كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيْرٌ\nINNAKA A'LAA KULLI SHAY'IN QADEER\nVerily, You have power over all things.",
  "merits": "In his book of Jamal al-Usbu', Sayyid Ibn Tawus has recorded a special prayer and supplication for each of the Holy Imams (a.s.), to be offered on Fridays.\nImam al-Hasan (a.s.)'s prayer consists of four units. In each unit, recite [Surah al-Fatihah](A5) once and [Surah al-Tawhid](A116) twenty-five times."
}
